  FontSlant->"Plain",ExpressionUUID->"d41b1dcb-0250-2d47-a160-f78fc4c2d974"],
 " pairs."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1840994462,ExpressionUUID->"9e62fa99-37f5-6848-8eb0-42f7f27f8a5f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["stateFunction", "TI",
   FontFamily->"Times",
   FontSlant->"Italic"]], "InlineFormula",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "c18a7761-06f2-c646-99e6-485ddbebd34e"],
 " acts on each eigenvector. For example, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "#", "]"}], "^", "4"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}]], 
  "InlineCode",
  ScriptLevel->0,
  ShowStringCharacters->True,
  FontFamily->"Source Code Pro",
  FontWeight->"Plain",
  FontSlant->"Plain",ExpressionUUID->"ce247487-cde6-c349-8ace-5403afa0d32b"],
 " gives its inverse participation ratio when the state is normalized."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->1074144565,ExpressionUUID->"3bfdadbc-1eb7-c449-95b0-a332d18d0f46"],

